### C.jet_bitcoin_indexed_scalar_jets.bitcoin_input_sequence_local_spec
bitcoin_input_sequence_local_spec
     : jet_application_sep.application_jet_local_spec_sep jets_bitcoin.f_simplicity_bitcoin_input_sequence
